Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.61,0:00:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.75,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, but so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.65,0:01:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.87,0:01:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:01:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where can I find Crocodile?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.08,0:02:06.29,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(950,900)\blur0.6\bord2\c&H080808&\3c&H080808&\1a&HFF&\t(905,950,\1a&H00&)\t(5310,5355,\1a&HFF&)}Rainbase, the City of Dreams
Dialogue: 2,0:02:00.08,0:02:06.29,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(950,900)\blur0.6\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\4a&HFF&}Rainbase, the City of Dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.07,0:02:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.31,0:02:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to go find Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.97,0:02:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.05,0:02:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That does seem like the quickest way of\Nstopping the fighting from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.75,0:02:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can quit wandering\Naround the desert, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was beginning to get old.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, where is he anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.75,0:02:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This damn Crocodile? Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.65,0:02:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the capital city,\NAlubarna, where my father rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the rebel army is camped here,\Ngetting ready to invade Alubarna.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we just need to get to Crocodile\Nbefore the rebels can get to Alubarna.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where Crocodile is. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.73,0:02:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain Base?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a city a bit to the north of\Nus, about a day's journey from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.15,0:02:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.06,0:03:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did I or did I not tell the two of you to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quit with the pathetic\Nmoaning all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get to ride on the damn camel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could at least let us\Nride Eyelash for a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.97,0:03:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a big fat camel hawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off your high horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, you've managed to\Nmake it all day without collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.57,0:03:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm trying hard not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, does this rain-based\Ncity have a water supply?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, no shortage there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a gambling town, almost completely\Nisolated from all the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Gambling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.05,0:03:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way Nami, we're not\Ngoing there to gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess people need some places\Nto relax, even here in Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.85,0:03:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, give me some!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Lupe, just give\Nme one sip of it, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that why he gave it to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.33,0:03:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old guy from the\Nsandstorm place gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.07,0:03:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had to dig all night\Njust to get this much of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.31,0:03:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just go drinking it like it's\Nregular water or something, so no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can restrain yourself sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, of course I can, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.91,0:04:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a rude thing to say, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.01,0:04:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take another step. Hey, water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how long till rain base, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.43,0:04:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.51,0:04:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have been able to\Nmake this decision on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then give me food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.65,0:04:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I beat up Crocodile, give me food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll eat till I explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.65,0:04:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I will.
