Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.07,0:04:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me join you in the Rebels!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.69,0:04:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't I have every right to\Nbe part of the rebellion, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.23,0:04:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate the king and the royal army.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me fight with\Nyou so I can prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.25,0:04:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barakla, show the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got that wound trying to protect\Nme in the middle of a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.07,0:05:06.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to see the medical\Ntents and the grave sites, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.79,0:05:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.61,0:05:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cities have dried up\Nand a lot of people have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,died because the king stole\Nall the rain from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends got sick because\Nthere wasn't enough water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all the King's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.89,0:05:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only want the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.31,0:05:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.31,0:05:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of getting\Ninjured or even dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where you're different from us\Nand why I can't let you join our ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.29,0:05:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all afraid and\Nnone of us want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.55,0:05:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, why do you fight then, Koza?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.55,0:05:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't do it because we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do it because we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.03,0:05:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because that's what our\Ncountry needs us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether you understand that or not\Nmakes little difference, so just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.29,0:05:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, I told you to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.23,0:05:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Battle is no place for\Na child, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Koza?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like you to rant and rave\Nlike that, especially at a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like looking at\Nmyself when I was his age.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made me angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the worst part is I haven't\Nchanged a bit since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.59,0:06:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have we gathered all\Nthe weapons we require?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's proving quite difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.03,0:06:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to begin contacting\Nall the other towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as we have all the weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will begin our final\NAlto attack on Alubarna.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.13,0:06:26.36,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,634)\fad(800,0)\blur0.5\bord2.8\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(755,800,\1a&H00&)}Alubarna Palace
Dialogue: 2,0:06:23.13,0:06:26.36,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,634)\blur0.5\bord0\alpha&HFF&\t(0,800,1.3,\alpha&H00&)}Alubarna Palace
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sire, it's only a matter of time now\Nbefore the rebel army attacks Alubarna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.19,0:06:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must take action against the\Nrebels quickly before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.25,0:06:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.23,0:06:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll not attack them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not some little quarrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We strike first, they will strike back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sire, we are barely clinging\Nto power right now as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.65,0:06:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That does not matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about my rule at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since the Dance Powder incident,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's been clear that someone's\Ntrying to tear apart our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting that\Nwe attack our citizens
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before we determine who's behind all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.21,0:06:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because that would be the true\Ndestruction of our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:06:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.94,0:07:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A country is its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.51,0:07:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But sir, whoever is behind this\Nhasn't shown himself so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't sit back and wait for\Nthis unknown force to divide us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.55,0:07:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must act. Can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king will not allow us\Nto take the offensive now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can barely even keep our own\Nsoldiers happy at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.43,0:07:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would feel much better if we had\NIgaram with us at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Igaram has left a note saying that\Nhe's leaving the island for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.24,0:07:37.62,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(401,635)\fad(800,800)\blur0.5\bord2.1\fs56.25\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(755,800,\1a&H00&)\t(7580,7625,\1a&HFF&)}Lt. Chaka "the Jackal"\N(Acting Commander)\NArabasta Royal Guard
Dialogue: 2,0:07:29.24,0:07:37.62,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(401,635)\fad(800,800)\blur0.5\bord0\fs56.25\4a&HFF&}Lt. Chaka "the Jackal"\N(Acting Commander)\NArabasta Royal Guard
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.24,0:07:37.62,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1124,645)\fad(800,800)\blur0.5\bord1.9\fs56.25\c&H0A0A0A&\3c&H0A0A0A&\1a&HFF&\t(755,800,\1a&H00&)\t(7580,7625,\1a&HFF&)}Lt. Pell "the Falcon"\NArabasta Royal Guard
Dialogue: 2,0:07:29.24,0:07:37.62,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1124,645)\fad(800,800)\blur0.5\bord0\fs56.25\4a&HFF&}Lt. Pell "the Falcon"\NArabasta Royal Guard
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even as we speak, he and Princess\NVivi are still out there somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying hard to figure\Nout who's behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.91,0:07:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka! Pal! Come quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.63,0:07:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.13,0:07:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's returned to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karu's back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.57,0:07:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who sent that letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.25,0:08:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my Vivi's handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.17,0:08:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo brought news from Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.83,0:08:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything I've written\Nhere is true beyond a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.69,0:08:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please read this letter carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've discovered the identity of the person\Nwho's trying to destroy Alabasta Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a warlord of the sea, Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of Crocodile, Igaram is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.05,0:08:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He died as he lived,\Na hero to his country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stupidly thought he was\Nloyal to the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.87,0:08:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never even wondered if he\Nwas the one behind all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he be dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He died as he would have wanted,\Nprotecting Princess Vivi and Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.53,0:08:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, Father, I have joined forces\Nwith an amazing group of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.73,0:09:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have given me great\Nconfidence and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.39,0:09:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I continue to work beside them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.43,0:09:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe we will be able to make\Na difference in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.01,0:09:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have reason to hope now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alabasta can and will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.83,0:09:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please have faith, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.53,0:09:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.09,0:09:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi's letter mentions that you\Nfought very valiantly as well, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You served her well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it looks like you've been hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, no matter what happens\Non that island, Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this thing on all our arms\Nis a sign of our friendship!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know the enemy's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.57,0:09:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare the soldiers to move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.45,0:09:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe's courage and Igaram's\Ndeath won't be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to take action now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll head for Rainbase and Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please do not be so hasty, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rainbase is far away and there\Nare many preparations to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, Crocodile has many of\Nthe citizens firmly on his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even more of them than you do,\NSire, with all due respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we send forces to\NRainbase now, your majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.81,0:10:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the rebels will use our absence to attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they will take the palace easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if the rebel army\Ndestroys this palace completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.77,0:10:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is only a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've told you before, a\Ncountry is its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if our royal army does fall in the\Nend, if we can just defeat Crocodile?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this country can still be reborn as\Nlong as its people are safe and whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.65,0:10:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we battle the rebel army\Ninstead, then that will all change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.01,0:10:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that situation, Crocodile's the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.21,0:10:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.69,0:10:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For right now, we do not need to\Nbe focusing on the rebel army.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just need to take out Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.43,0:10:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one of the seven warlords\Nof the sea that we're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:10:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is strong and cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be many casualties, but we\Nmust accept that and battle onward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.61,0:11:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, we need to hold a war council.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.15,0:11:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assemble the officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.99,0:11:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pell, scout ahead and\Nconduct reconnaissance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.99,0:11:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for having\Nunderestimated you, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a true man of your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We head for battle tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, all soldiers are\Nto head for rain base.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.29,0:11:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is that the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.23,0:11:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.57,0:11:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to kick crocodile's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.91,0:11:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Rainbase, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So after all that's happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are we operating under the\Nassumption that Baroque
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.13,0:12:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Works knows that we're here\Non the island with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did run into Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I think it's safe to\Nassume that they have at
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.23,0:12:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,least some idea that we\Nwere headed to Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.65,0:12:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They know exactly what we look like,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we won't be able to do much of\Nanything while we're in rain base.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.37,0:12:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just lay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if we get spotted\Nbefore we can find Crocodile,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.51,0:12:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he can probably come up with all\Nsorts of nasty ways of taking care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Assassination is kind of\Ntheir area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laying low, but we're coming, Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.01,0:12:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't even listening, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.85,0:12:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no matter what happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.27,0:12:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will take it upon myself to\Nprotect Nami and Vivi from any harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.99,0:12:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always happy to play Prince Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a lady. Smooth one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.63,0:12:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoother than you are, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is none. Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water... I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.43,0:12:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, move me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you might want to\Ntake some money along.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.78,0:13:02.99,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,946)\fad(700,0)\blur0.5\bord2.7\fscx88\fscy88\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(655,700,\1a&H00&)}Rainbase, the City of Dreams
Dialogue: 2,0:12:58.78,0:13:02.99,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,946)\fad(700,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx88\fscy88\4a&HFF&}Rainbase, the City of Dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.69,0:13:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker, why do you\Nthink that they'll be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What reason would the Straw Hats\Nhave for coming to Rain Base?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just call it a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally we can get water!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't put my finger on\Nit, but something stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just feel like there's something\Nbig lurking in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.55,0:13:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old lady, give us some water, King!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.15,0:13:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.09,0:13:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A whole barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we want more than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.03,0:13:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My barrel, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.31,0:13:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then you really do believe that\Nthere is some sort of a connection
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.19,0:13:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,between the Baroque Works Crime\NOrganization and the Straw Hats crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.35,0:13:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I know for sure is that\NStraw Hat is out to get Crocodile,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of the Seven Warlords of the Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is about forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry up and get\Nour marks on the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go use the little boys' room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.13,0:14:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think we can count\Non them to stay out of trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.43,0:14:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even they can handle little errands, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet they managed\Nto screw something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is Usopp and Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd start getting ready\Nto run if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.99,0:14:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.75,0:14:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.86,0:14:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, we're going after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the marines to Shoujou. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much do I owe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.45,0:14:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you know those brats, you'd better\Nadd all the water they took to your tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.69,0:14:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.65,0:14:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the damn marines doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just keep running for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:14:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the Marines are chasing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.97,0:15:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why are those idiots running this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tony hasn't made\Nhis way back here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper can manage on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, I think the teams are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.71,0:15:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hadn't noticed that, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't lose them this time, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.85,0:15:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those idiots sure can run.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.59,0:15:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give them that anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brokeworks will see us, if\Nwe run through the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's a little\Ntoo late for that, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.19,0:15:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's decided! Let's go! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.87,0:15:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever Crocodile is,\Nhow about it? Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.77,0:15:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see that building up ahead\Nwith the alligator on its roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the casino that Crocodile runs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called Rain Dinners!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's where Crocodile is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.13,0:16:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be better if we all split up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's looking that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.19,0:16:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.29,0:16:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't die! They split up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.37,0:16:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lose them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.21,0:16:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smokey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got some real\Nnerve there, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't think you can run forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,White vine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.45,0:16:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.97,0:16:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.59,0:16:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.17,0:16:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's them, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt. Kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.69,0:16:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's the\NBaroque work's millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.31,0:16:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then I guess we're stuck\Nbetween a rock and a hard place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:16:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.15,0:16:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.97,0:17:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look after Nami. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.79,0:17:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm on it. But Sanji! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without that smoke freak around,\Nthey should be easy to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.53,0:17:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bushido will be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all really pathetic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.41,0:17:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro, I knew we'd meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.53,0:17:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:17:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing carelessly\Ncutting down civilians like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's low even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.07,0:18:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I have my own reasons\Nfor doing it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.51,0:18:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I have absolutely no desire\Nwhatsoever to fight you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We settled our dispute fine in Loguetown.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.85,0:18:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't even dealt you a single blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.89,0:18:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duh, she looked way too much like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.07,0:18:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And put that damn face\Nof yours away, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're insulting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.61,0:18:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a really pathetic tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh, she's the one\Nperson I can't handle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.79,0:18:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, you rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.69,0:18:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's two of them, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.33,0:18:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.24,0:18:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.71,0:18:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.15,0:18:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the entrance to Rain Dinners!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it looks like it's\Nin the middle of a lake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.07,0:19:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.98,0:19:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.69,0:19:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like fish in a barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.69,0:19:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I thought Vivi was\Nsupposed to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.18,0:19:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying she's not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet, but maybe she\Njust went inside already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go in too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.17,0:19:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that smoker guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.07,0:19:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to run inside now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I guess that's where I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Phoebe and the pirates\Nare in town paying us a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.83,0:19:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we just received word from\Nthe millions that they've arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's be sure to welcome\Nthem very warmly. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, and I'm\Nabout to kick your sandy ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.17,0:20:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready!

